      "cooked": "<p>Hey guys!</p><p>Over the next two months, I'm going to be running a Sentinel Tactics tournament. There are going to be events in Melbourne, Sydney, Brisbane, Canberra and Toowoomba - prizes for first and second place at each will be a 3-day pass to PAX Australia, where there will be a grand final with cash prizes.</p><p><span>Does anyone from any of the towns listed above have suggestions for the best place to hold the tournaments? I'm after a FLGS for each city that has room to hold the tournament and a good relationship with its customers.</span></p><p><span>Let me know if anywhere springs to mind! Stay tuned for more details.</span></p>",
